# Read automatically by `vite build` (see vite.config.ts / Vite's own env
# file convention -- no code change needed to pick this up). Previously set
# via `VITE_API_BASE=... npm run build` in tauri.conf.json's
# beforeBuildCommand, but that inline VAR=value prefix is bash-only syntax
# and breaks on Windows (cmd.exe/PowerShell don't support it) -- an .env
# file works identically on every platform.
VITE_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1
